---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面不存在 - 满分虎体育">
  <section class="notfound">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="notfound-card">
        <div class="notfound-icon">🤔</div>
        <h1>404</h1>
        <p>这个页面走丢了，可能是链接过期或地址输错了。</p>
        <div class="notfound-actions">
          <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">返回首页</a>
          <a href="/news/" class="btn btn-outline">看看资讯</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .notfound { padding: 100px 0; min-height: 50vh; display: flex; align-items: center; }
  .notfound-card {
    max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;
    padding: 48px 40px; border-radius: 16px;
    background: var(--c-surface); border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
  }
  .notfound-icon { font-size: 3.5rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .notfound-card h1 { font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--c-primary); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .notfound-card p { color: var(--c-text-muted); margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .notfound-actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; }
  .btn { padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--c-primary); color: #fff; }
  .btn-outline { border: 2px solid var(--c-primary); color: var(--c-primary); }
</style>
